Package: QuantifyPolyA
Type: Package
Title: Quantify the Poly(A) Profile from 3' End Sequencing Data
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
 person("Congting", "Ye", email = "yec@xmu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: QuantifyPolyA is a complete and seamless R package for accurately
 quantifying poly(A) usages under diverse biological conditions. It employs a
 weighted density peak clustering algorithm to address the innate
 microheterogeneity of cleavage and polyadenylation.
License: GPL (>= 3)
